      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ISEEUBABY (5) comes here following a ninth behind Copy Cat Queen at Group Three level a week-and-a-half ago over 2130m at Gloucester Park. Class act who will be hard to beat. DEL BOCAVISTA BAY (10) went back last start and didn't measure up when 30 metres from the winner in eighth at this track over 2631m. That effort followed successive wins, the most recent at this track on October 12. Draws out a little on the second line and may need luck at some point. Meets a comparable field and he can bounce back straight away. GULLY GUM (2) disappointed last time when eighth over 2185m at this track. Can make amends. HILLVIEW BONDI (7) is the best of the rest after finishing fifth over 2185m at this track last time out.",
